---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const label = "text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-text-muted mb-4";
---

<BaseLayout>
    <header
        class="min-h-[38vh] flex flex-col justify-end pb-12 md:pb-16 px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 max-w-300 mx-auto"
    >
        <p class="text-[16px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-text-muted mb-8">
            Lukas Andersen
        </p>
        <h1
            class="font-serif text-[clamp(1.75rem,4.5vw,3.5rem)] font-light leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.02em] text-text-primary max-w-[800px]"
        >
            I build AI systems that do real work inside a business, and I
            have room for one build this quarter.
        </h1>
    </header>

    <section class="bg-bg-dark py-24 lg:py-32">
        <div class="px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 max-w-300 mx-auto">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12">
                <h2
                    class="text-[16px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-text-secondary-on-dark md:col-span-4 mb-8 md:mb-0"
                >
                    In production
                </h2>
                <div class="md:col-span-7 md:col-start-6">
                    <p
                        class="text-[19px] md:text-[22px] leading-[1.6] text-text-on-dark mb-6"
                    >
                        Since August 2026 a California pest-control company
                        has filed its termite inspection reports through a
                        system I built and run. The inspector talks through
                        the property on an iPad and taps submit. The state
                        report, its findings and the diagram are in the
                        office's Salesforce under a minute later. Before, the
                        report reached the office a median of one day after
                        the inspection, and four days at the ninetieth
                        percentile.
                    </p>
                    <p
                        class="text-[19px] md:text-[22px] leading-[1.6] text-text-on-dark mb-6"
                    >
                        All four of the company's inspectors use it every
                        day. The office still reviews every report before it
                        goes out, and every correction they make becomes a
                        test. They pay for it.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-bg-primary py-24 lg:py-32">
        <div class="px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 max-w-300 mx-auto">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12">
                <h2
                    class="text-[16px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-text-muted md:col-span-4 mb-8 md:mb-0"
                >
                    What I take on
                </h2>
                <div class="md:col-span-7 md:col-start-6">
                    <p
                        class="text-[19px] md:text-[22px] leading-[1.6] text-text-primary mb-6"
                    >
                        One fixed-scope build at a time, four to eight weeks,
                        priced by the week. The shape I know: a messy input,
                        spoken, on paper, in a form or an inbox, that has to
                        become a document somebody signs or files, written
                        into the system the business already runs.
                    </p>
                    <p
                        class="text-[19px] md:text-[22px] leading-[1.6] text-text-primary mb-6"
                    >
                        How it is built: narrow typed steps rather than a
                        chatty agent. The model can only choose from the
                        business's own vocabulary. Every output is stamped
                        with the model and prompt that made it. A test suite
                        built from real cases gates every change. The system
                        never deletes anything, and one setting turns it off.
                    </p>
                    <p
                        class="text-[19px] md:text-[22px] leading-[1.6] text-text-primary"
                    >
                        I work directly with the owner and the people who do
                        the work. No account manager, no team to brief.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-bg-surface py-24 lg:py-32">
        <div class="px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 max-w-300 mx-auto">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12">
                <h2
                    class="text-[16px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-text-muted md:col-span-4 mb-8 md:mb-0"
                >
                    Before this
                </h2>
                <div class="md:col-span-7 md:col-start-6">
                    <p
                        class="text-[19px] md:text-[22px] leading-[1.6] text-text-primary mb-6"
                    >
                        Twelve years of full-stack engineering in San
                        Francisco. Seven at HouseCanary, where I led the team
                        behind a data platform that drove 40% of the
                        company's revenue. Engineering lead at Airbyte.
                        Intel before that.
                    </p>
                    <p
                        class="text-[19px] md:text-[22px] leading-[1.6] text-text-primary"
                    >
                        Anvil, the company I run, is the vehicle for this
                        work.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-bg-dark py-24 lg:py-32" id="contact">
        <div class="px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 max-w-300 mx-auto">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12">
                <h2
                    class="text-[16px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-text-secondary-on-dark md:col-span-4 mb-8 md:mb-0"
                >
                    Talk
                </h2>
                <div class="md:col-span-7 md:col-start-6">
                    <p
                        class="text-[19px] md:text-[22px] leading-[1.6] text-text-on-dark mb-8"
                    >
                        If you have a workflow of that shape, write and
                        describe it in a few lines. I'll tell you within a day
                        whether it is a fit and what it would cost.
                    </p>
                    <a
                        href="mailto:lukas@lukasandersen.com?subject=A%20build"
                        class="text-[19px] md:text-[22px] text-text-on-dark underline underline-offset-4 decoration-text-secondary-on-dark hover:decoration-text-on-dark transition-colors block mb-3"
                        >lukas@lukasandersen.com</a
                    >
                    <a
                        href="tel:+15106216620"
                        class="text-[19px] md:text-[22px] text-text-on-dark underline underline-offset-4 decoration-text-secondary-on-dark hover:decoration-text-on-dark transition-colors block"
                        >(510) 621-6620</a
                    >
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="bg-bg-primary py-20 md:py-24">
        <div class="px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 max-w-[1200px] mx-auto">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 md:gap-0">
                <div class="md:col-span-4">
                    <p class={label}>Lukas Andersen</p>
                    <p class="text-[15px] text-text-secondary">
                        Production AI for businesses that run on paper and
                        phone calls.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="md:col-span-3 md:col-start-6">
                    <p class={label}>Contact</p>
                    <a
                        href="mailto:lukas@lukasandersen.com"
                        class="text-[15px] text-text-primary hover:text-accent transition-colors block mb-2"
                        >lukas@lukasandersen.com</a
                    >
                    <a
                        href="tel:+15106216620"
                        class="text-[15px] text-text-primary hover:text-accent transition-colors block"
                        >(510) 621-6620</a
                    >
                </div>
                <div class="md:col-span-3 md:col-start-10">
                    <p class={label}>Elsewhere</p>
                    <a
                        href="https://linkedin.com/in/llandersen"
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer"
                        class="text-[15px] text-text-primary hover:text-accent transition-colors block mb-2"
                        >LinkedIn</a
                    >
                    <a
                        href="https://github.com/slate71"
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer"
                        class="text-[15px] text-text-primary hover:text-accent transition-colors block"
                        >GitHub</a
                    >
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>
</BaseLayout>
